[{"client_msg_id":"D0EFF336-50F3-40F5-A93D-014F276E84C3","type":"message","user":"U02269AAADD","text":"なるほど、なんとなくわかってきました。styledの返り値に渡すと、生成されるコンポーネントにいくつかのpropsを追加してくれるのが `space` とか `typography` ということなのですね。これだけなら案外と単純かも。","ts":"1636286762.344100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yXK78"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68b4f9b3-72ca-47a6-903b-875bfc3c1d10","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"そうですね。\n既存の UI コンポーネントに `mt={2}` みたいなのを生やすことができるので重宝してます。","ts":"1636280920.339700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TcFPS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83652D66-1626-4EB0-BBDF-CBE43D6F8554","type":"message","user":"U02269AAADD","text":"ありがとうございます。これでスペーサー使うとしたら、載ってるままこんな感じでしょうか？\n```// example Spacer component\nimport styled from 'styled-components'\nimport { space } from 'styled-system'\n\nconst Spacer = styled.div(space)```\n\u003chttps://styled-system.com/guides/spacing|https://styled-system.com/guides/spacing\u003e","ts":"1636280196.338100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Styled System","id":1,"title":"Styled System","title_link":"https://styled-system.com/guides/spacing","text":"Style props for rapid UI development","thumb_url":"https://styled-system.com/logo.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"styled-system.com","service_icon":"https://styled-system.com/logo.png","thumb_width":512,"thumb_height":512,"from_url":"https://styled-system.com/guides/spacing","original_url":"https://styled-system.com/guides/spacing"}],"edited":{"user":"U02269AAADD","ts":"1636280208.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8JXG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37D03B73-CD05-4D5C-BF1E-CA019429DB84","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://styled-system.com|https://styled-system.com\u003e\nこういうのを使ったりしてます。","ts":"1636279495.336700","attachments":[{"fallback":"Styled System","id":1,"t